---
---
<div class="diagram" role="img" aria-label="Split-screen comparison: the user sees a normal Copilot summary while hidden instructions from a poisoned email execute with ambient authority, exfiltrating data before the user logs back in">
  <div class="diagram-label">Zero-Click Attack Surface</div>
  <div class="zc-split" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="zc-side">
      <div class="zc-side-label">// WHAT YOU SEE</div>
      <div class="zc-terminal">
        <div class="zc-line">
          <span class="zc-prompt">&gt;</span>
          <span class="zc-input">summarize my week</span>
        </div>
        <div class="zc-line zc-line--resp">Here's your summary for May 12–16:</div>
        <div class="zc-line zc-line--resp zc-line--indent">• 3 meetings rescheduled</div>
        <div class="zc-line zc-line--resp zc-line--indent">• Q3 planning doc updated by Marta</div>
        <div class="zc-line zc-line--resp zc-line--indent">• Travel approved for June conference</div>
        <div class="zc-line zc-line--resp zc-line--indent">• No action items flagged</div>
        <div class="zc-status">
          <span class="zc-dot"></span>
          <span>Done</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="zc-divider">
      <div class="zc-divider-line"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="zc-side zc-side--right">
      <div class="zc-side-label zc-side-label--danger">// WHAT'S HAPPENING</div>
      <div class="zc-chain">
        <div class="zc-step">
          <span class="zc-step-num">01</span>
          <span class="zc-step-text">Copilot pulls 847 documents as context — emails, files, chats</span>
        </div>
        <div class="zc-pipe"></div>
        <div class="zc-step zc-step--danger">
          <span class="zc-step-num zc-step-num--danger">02</span>
          <span class="zc-step-text">One email contains hidden instructions invisible to the user</span>
        </div>
        <div class="zc-pipe zc-pipe--danger"></div>
        <div class="zc-step zc-step--danger">
          <span class="zc-step-num zc-step-num--danger">03</span>
          <span class="zc-step-text">Instructions execute with full access to inbox, files, and chats</span>
        </div>
        <div class="zc-pipe zc-pipe--danger"></div>
        <div class="zc-step zc-step--danger">
          <span class="zc-step-num zc-step-num--danger">04</span>
          <span class="zc-step-text">An image quietly loads — your stolen data is encoded in the request, sent to an attacker's server disguised as normal web traffic</span>
        </div>
        <div class="zc-pipe"></div>
        <div class="zc-step">
          <span class="zc-step-num">05</span>
          <span class="zc-step-text">Copilot generates the summary you asked for. Nothing looks wrong.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="zc-breach">
        <span class="zc-breach-dot"></span>
        <span class="zc-breach-text">Breach complete — user not present</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .zc-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .zc-side {
    padding: var(--space-md);
  }

  .zc-side-label {
    font-size: var(--text-chrome);
    color: var(--accent-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .zc-side-label--danger {
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cherry) 70%, var(--gray));
  }

  .zc-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
  }

  .zc-divider-line {
    width: 1px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--gray-rule) 0px,
      var(--gray-rule) 4px,
      transparent 4px,
      transparent 8px
    );
  }

  /* ---- Left side: calm terminal ---- */
  .zc-terminal {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .zc-line {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-secondary);
    color: var(--gray);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .zc-line--resp { color: var(--white); }

  .zc-line--indent {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    color: var(--gray);
  }

  .zc-prompt {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .zc-input {
    color: var(--white);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .zc-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
    font-size: var(--text-chrome);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .zc-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Right side: numbered chain ---- */
  .zc-chain {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .zc-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .zc-step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-chrome);
    color: var(--gray-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-width: 1.3rem;
  }

  .zc-step-num--danger {
    color: var(--cherry);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .zc-step-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-secondary);
    color: var(--gray);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .zc-step--danger .zc-step-text {
    color: var(--cherry);
  }

  .zc-pipe {
    width: 1px;
    height: 0.6rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--gray-rule) 60%, transparent);
    margin-left: 0.55rem;
  }

  .zc-pipe--danger {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cherry) 40%, transparent);
  }

  /* ---- Breach status: loudest element ---- */
  .zc-breach {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--cherry) 40%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--cherry) 6%, transparent);
  }

  .zc-breach-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--cherry);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px color-mix(in srgb, var(--cherry) 50%, transparent);
  }

  .zc-breach-text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-ui);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--cherry);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .zc-split {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .zc-divider {
      padding: 0 var(--space-md);
      height: 1px;
    }

    .zc-divider-line {
      width: 100%;
      height: 1px;
      background: repeating-linear-gradient(
        to right,
        var(--gray-rule) 0px,
        var(--gray-rule) 4px,
        transparent 4px,
        transparent 8px
      );
    }
  }
</style>
